OL,3,GNEWSACash machine dumped on M1 after
OL,4,Asuspected ram raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cash machine was found abandoned on
OL,7,Fan M1 slip road after police were
OL,8,Falerted to reports of a ram raid at a
OL,9,Fvillage shop.
OL,11,FBedfordshire Police said officers were
OL,12,Fcalled to a convenience store in High
OL,13,FStreet, Toddington, at about 04:50 BST
OL,14,Fon Wednesday.
OL,16,FOfficers said three men loaded the cash
OL,17,Fmachine into a white van before
OL,18,Fabandoning both on the slip road
OL,19,Fleading to the northbound M1 at
OL,20,Fjunction 12.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
